then the $0 blind test; supersedes D735's full restatement | in force | `docs/DECISIONS-log.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11236:## D737 · 2026-11-22 · Alex: shrink judging-v13's format to the checks that stop the named defects, then a $0 blind test\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/ledger.attempts.jsonl\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/ledger.json\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/answers.jsonl\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/retries.jsonl\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/gate.launcher.lock\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/plan.json\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/results.json\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/ledger.lock\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/pair-old-1-separate-v8-d2-a1.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/pair-old-1-separate-v4-d3-a1.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/pair-old-3-separate-v35-d2-a2.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/pair-old-3-joint-d1-a2.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/pair-old-2-separate-v14-d2-a2.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/single-S-single-d3-a1.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/pair-old-3-joint-d3-a1.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/pair-old-2-separate-v9-d2-a2.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/pair-old-1-separate-v4-d1-a2.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/pair-old-2-joint-d2-a2.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/single-E-single-d1-a2.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/pair-old-3-separate-v3-d2-a2.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/pair-old-1-joint-d2-a2.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/single-S-single-d1-a2.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-paid-gate-2026-11-22/archives/single-O-single-d2-a1.sqlite\npoc/data/judging-v13-