110% of the $392 billion analyst estimate).', 'Total revenue is at least $392 billion and below $431.2 billion.', 'Total revenue is at least $352.8 billion and below $392 billion (within 10% below the analyst estimate).', 'Total revenue is at least $313.6 billion and below $352.8 billion.', 'Total revenue is below $313.6 billion (more than 20% below the analyst estimate).']}, 'v35': {'question': 'What will NVIDIA report as data-center revenue for FY2027?', 'ladder': ['FY2027 data-center revenue is at least $400 billion.', 'FY2027 data-center revenue is at least $361 billion but less than $400 billion.', 'FY2027 data-center revenue is at least $300 billion but less than $361 billion.', 'FY2027 data-center revenue is at least $250 billion but less than $300 billion.', 'FY2027 data-center revenue is less than $250 billion.']}}\npair-old-3 separate-v3 260 {'v3': {'question': 'What will NVIDIA report as total revenue for FY2027?', 'ladder': ['Total revenue is at least $431.2 billion (110% of the $392 billion analyst estimate).', 'Total revenue is at least $392 billion and below $431.2 billion.', 'Total revenue is at least $352.8 billion and below $392 billion (within 10% below the analyst estimate).', 'Total revenue is at least $313.6 billion and below $352.8 billion.', 'Total revenue is below $313.6 billion (more than 20% below the analyst estimate).']}}\npair-old-3 separate-v35 260 {'v35': {'question': 'What will NVIDIA report as data-center revenue for FY2027?', 'ladder': ['FY2027 data-center revenue is at least $400 billion.', 'FY2027 data-center revenue is at least $361 billion but less than $400 billion.', 'FY2027 data-center revenue is at least $300 billion but less than $361 billion.', 'FY2027 data-center revenue is at least $250 billion but less than $300 billion.', 'FY2027 data-center revenue is less than $250 billion.']}}\nsingle-O single 35 {'v29': {'question': \"How much will NVIDIA's equity investment commitments reach at the publication of its FY2027 annual report?\", 'ladder': ['Commitments are below $25 billion.', 'Commitments are at least $25 billion and below $50 billion.', 'Commitments are at least $50 billion and below $75 billion.', 'Commitments are at least $75 billion and below $100 billion.', 'Commitments are at least $100 billion.']}}\nsingle-S single 31 {'v6': {'question': 'How much will the four largest AI hyperscalers spend on data-center capital expenditures in calendar 2027?', 'ladder': ['Combined spending is less than $800 billion.', 'Combined spending is at least $800 billion and less than $900 billion.', 'Combined spending is at least $900 billion and less than $1.1 trillion.', 'Combined spending is at least $1.1 trillion and less than $1.2 trillion.', 'Combined spending is at least $1.2 trillion.']}}\nsingle-E single 15 {'v41': {'question': 'What will NVIDIA report as Vera CPU revenue for FY2028?', 'ladder': ['FY2028 Vera CPU revenue is at least $50 billion.', 'FY2028 Vera CPU revenue is at least $40 billion and less than $50 billion.', 'FY2028 Vera CPU revenue is at least $30 billion and less than $40 billion.', 'FY2028 Vera CPU revenue is at least $20 billion and less than $30 billion.', 'FY2028 Vera CPU revenue is less than $20 billion.']}}\nUS\\$ 7\ne5096 Recently, JPMorgan analyst Richard Choe issued a rare double-upgrade on IREN after the company signed a roughly US$5.50 billion, five-year partnership with Nvidia tied to its fast-growing AI cloud services platform.\ne5124 Recently, JPMorgan analyst Richard Choe issued a rare double-upgrade on IREN after the company signed a roughly US$5.50 billion, five-year partnership with Nvidia tied to its fast-growing AI cloud services platform.\ne5125 Among recent announcements, the US$3.65 billion GPU financing facility stands out alongside the Nvidia deal.\ne4798 Recently, JPMorgan analyst Richard Choe issued a rare double-upgrade on IREN after the company signed a roughly US$5.50 billion, five-year partnership with Nvidia tied to its fast-growing AI cloud services platform.\ne4799 Among recent announcements, the US$3.65 billion GPU financing facility stands out alongside the Nvidia deal.\n\\$\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\\s*bn\\b 2\ne5267 Second-quarter revenue hit $96.2bn, up 106% year on year.\ne5268 Data centre revenue more than doubled to $89bn, while net income soared 126% to $59.7bn.\n\\$\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?B\\b 0\n(?:USD|RMB|CNY|NT\\$|€|£) 1\ne1926 What analysts expect the hyperscalers to spend in 2027 alone has more than doubled in the space of a year, from a consensus of $480 billion (€416bn) in August 2025 to $1.08 trillion (€943bn) this month, a rise of about 127%, according to Bank of America.\n\\btwice\\b 3\ne5299 Nvidia ( NASDAQ:NVDA ) CEO Jensen Huang expects the company to sell roughly twice as many chips next year as it does this year, pointing to continued demand for artificial intelligence technology across industries.\ne4918 CEO Jensen Huang talking about selling twice as many chips next year\ne5010 As Databricks CEO Ali Ghodsi explained to TechCrunch , two agent systems built around the same model can produce dramatically different bills. Choose the wrong setup, and the same task may cost roughly twice as much to complete.\n\\b(?:double|triple)\\b 19\ne5061 CEO Hock Tan told analysts earlier this month that Broadcom has secured the supply to double AI revenue to about $115 billion in fiscal 2027 -- and to $230 billion the year after.\ne5096 Recently, JPMorgan analyst Richard Choe issued a rare double-upgrade on IREN after the company signed a roughly US$5.50 billion, five-year partnership with Nvidia tied to its fast-growing AI cloud services platform.\ne5124 Recently, JPMorgan analyst Richard Choe issued a rare double-upgrade on IREN after the company signed a roughly US$5.50 billion, five-year partnership with Nvidia tied to its fast-growing AI cloud services platform.\ne2951 CFO Colette Kress explained that customer forecasts actually point to potential growth rates near double the guided 70%, but severe supply chain bottlenecks—ranging from memory availability to data center power and construction—are capping the company's near-term output.\ne4609 The company plans to double its monthly output of stacked memory to roughly 100,000 wafers by the end of this year.\n[–—−±] 21\ne2635 Anthropic plans to deploy up to 2 gigawatts of the Instinct MI450 GPUs in its Helios system beginning in the first half of 2027 — a deal that could be worth tens of billions of dollars over time.\ne3115 severe supply chain bottlenecks—ranging from memory availability to data center power and construction—are capping the company's near-term output.\ne5074 the Shenzhen-based firm introduced near-packaged optics (NPOs) – a placement structure enabling higher speeds and lower energy use – to the company’s SuperPoD architecture for the first time.\ne5104 At the Huawei Connect 2026 conference in Shanghai, the Shenzhen-based firm introduced near-packaged optics (NPOs) – a placement structure enabling higher speeds and lower energy use – to the company’s SuperPoD architecture for the first time.\ne5225 Since Nvidia isn't currently selling into the Chinese market, Huawei's advances – even if they're significant – are unlikely to have any impact on its finances in the near term.\n\\$\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\\s*(?:to|-)\\s*\\$?\\d 0\nanswers.jsonl basis Counter({'forecast': 135, 'reported': 96, 'third_party': 64, 'guidance': 47, 'consensus': 16})\nanswers.jsonl kind Counter({'source': 219, 'computed': 88, 'estimate': 51})\nanswers.jsonl operation Counter({None: 247, 'sum': 40, 'product': 19, 'apply_growth': 16, 'roll_forward': 11, 'difference': 9, 'share': 8, 'ratio': 6, 'range_from_relative': 1, 'growth': 1})\nanswers.jsonl unit Counter({'USD billions': 304, 'percent': 39, 'times': 3, 'proportion': 3, 'ratio': 2, 'fraction': 2, '%': 2, 'share': 2, 'percent above guidance high end': 1})\nanswers.jsonl component Counter({'value': 299, None: 19, 'midpoint': 15, 'relative': 13, 'bound': 6, 'multiplier': 3, 'hi