e in fiscal 2028.', 'speaker': \"Bram Berkowitz, fool.com, reporting Colette Kress's statement\"}\nanswers.jsonl 36\nretries.jsonl 36\nspecial 22 single-S fig_consensus_2027 $1.08 trillion USD trillion 1.08\nspecial 22 single-S fig_nvidia_top_five_2027 $1.3 trillion USD trillion 1.3\nspecial 22 single-S fig_v6_forecast None USD trillion 1.05\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
